{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8015f7f03497bba7a4c12f1febdbd431e93b6c415c5aa63d08d2666167cbad50",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_b:2_4_011_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09f5a2ef60ea1b39853f86f06f149fa3da7a704b1ffa9a59f1a9ee8ea5f6b941",
      "text": "啊，喂喂，\n●●●●プロデューサー，现在有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_b:2_4_011_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:443e3a5706cb4daf282c49e080015fdf0ece318da2f42c12cde49ebe5f5f8b1d",
      "text": "上次的拍摄，在那么冷的天气里一直支持着我们，\n谢谢你。那之后你没有着凉感冒吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_b:2_4_011_01_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d343ca896cf656862d861688fd5198331ffd14c267246db044a087c376951e73",
      "text": "没事的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_b:2_4_011_01_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d164b718ebdcfa1f6bc72e6fe57c743d712f5237deaf2291696a0231687b7fd",
      "text": "那样就好。\n那是个很棒的滑雪场呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_b:2_4_011_01_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd3f4c5a6152f2d97c446e1bad8e10d81f47bc281e1aebc2653d9f87bcd31f7a",
      "text": "如果能以我们的工作为契机，\n吸引很多很多人前去的话就太让人高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_b:2_4_011_01_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:244d919f535d63ee4d161fff5daf1b4b3df0ef111dd0787d10c35d63bcc713c5",
      "text": "我们的广告能映入大家的眼帘，我现在就开始\n期待了呢。贴出来之后一定要去看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_401_2_4_011_01_09_b:2_4_011_01_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c755701ff75bb9073a63715fd5d25bf653e32c44b7b6bca9d84533f729fe265",
      "text": "要是时间合适的话要不要一起去？\n你能考虑一下的话我会很高兴的。那就这样啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
